**
!Dockerfile
!requirements.txt
!inference.py
!src/
!src/**
!configs/
!configs/**
!templates/
!templates/**
!resources/
!resources/task3_head.json
# ⚠️ The decision GRAPHS. `**` above denies everything, so a resource that is
# not named here does not enter the image and `policy_graph.load` fails at the
# first case -- the same mechanism that silently kept the RAG assets out of
# every image we ever built.
!resources/task1_graph.yaml
!resources/task2_graph.yaml
# ⚠️ Same mechanism, three more files the Dockerfile COPYs by name. Missing
# here on 2026-09-11 and caught by the pre-freeze audit: `**` denied them, so
# the COPY had no source and the build failed. `agentic_task1.yaml` is the one
# that is also needed at RUN time -- orchestrate.py reads its thresholds on
# every case, and briefs.confidence_rule cannot label a case without them.
!resources/agentic_task1.yaml
!resources/task1_policy.yaml
!resources/task2_policy.yaml
